        "content": "### Design finding\n\nThe current topology does **not** pass single-link N-1 because `core1--service-host` is the only service-facing link. Its loss makes both access prefixes unreachable.\n\nThe other nine failures retain reachability: five increase the shortest-path cost and four remove spare capacity without changing the active shortest path.\n\nThis dashboard is deterministic analysis of `lab/intent.yml`, not measured production availability.",
